{"82:1:1":"When","82:1:2":"the sky","82:1:3":"(is) cleft asunder","82:2:1":"And when","82:2:2":"the stars","82:2:3":"scatter","82:3:1":"And when","82:3:2":"the seas","82:3:3":"are made to gush forth","82:4:1":"And when","82:4:2":"the graves","82:4:3":"are overturned","82:5:1":"Will know","82:5:2":"a soul","82:5:4":"it has sent forth","82:5:5":"and left behind","82:6:2":"man","82:6:4":"has deceived you","82:6:5":"concerning your Lord","82:6:6":"the Most Noble","82:7:1":"Who","82:7:2":"created you","82:7:3":"then fashioned you","82:7:4":"then balanced you","82:8:3":"form","82:8:5":"He willed","82:8:6":"He assembled you","82:9:3":"you deny","82:9:4":"the Judgment","82:10:3":"(are) surely guardians","82:11:1":"Noble","82:11:2":"recording","82:12:1":"They know","82:12:3":"you do","82:13:2":"the righteous","82:13:4":"bliss","82:14:2":"the wicked","82:14:4":"Hellfire","82:15:1":"They will burn (in) it","82:15:2":"(on the) Day","82:15:3":"(of) the Judgment","82:16:4":"(will be) absent","82:17:2":"can make you know","82:17:4":"(is the) Day","82:17:5":"(of) the Judgment","82:18:3":"can make you know","82:18:5":"(is the) Day","82:18:6":"(of) the Judgment","82:19:1":"(The) Day","82:19:3":"will have power","82:19:4":"a soul","82:19:5":"for a soul","82:19:6":"anything","82:19:7":"and the Command","82:19:9":"(will be) with Allah"}
